[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5831.91, "timestamp": "01:37:11", "text": "这？等等，这是什么？我们去20"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5832.199, "timestamp": "01:37:12", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so the MC in silver palace is called the detective"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5833.43, "timestamp": "01:37:13", "text": "向前打结。而我想做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5835.59, "timestamp": "01:37:15", "text": "加速下一次跳跃。我喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5837.51, "timestamp": "01:37:17", "text": "尽可能快地完成这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5839.43, "timestamp": "01:37:19", "text": "下一个。我会循序渐进地进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5841.51, "timestamp": "01:37:21", "text": "快点，快点，快点。设身处地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.83, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "进入最坏情况。速度有多快？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5846.07, "timestamp": "01:37:26", "text": "我需要多久才能恢复？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 5847.077, "timestamp": "01:37:27", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "so im assuming we get to do interrogations"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5849.35, "timestamp": "01:37:29", "text": "所有这些案件都是可以追回的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5852.149, "timestamp": "01:37:32", "text": "来，我们把它戴上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5853.669, "timestamp": "01:37:33", "text": "我们再检查一下帧。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5855.35, "timestamp": "01:37:35", "text": "那是我的手部姿势。你的手"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5857.43, "timestamp": "01:37:37", "text": "位置不错。好了。你可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5859.91, "timestamp": "01:37:39", "text": "伙计，我的特技都是自己做的。你要知道我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5862.47, "timestamp": "01:37:42", "text": "总的。我的脑袋会是，我会像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5864.709, "timestamp": "01:37:44", "text": "这。这样好多了。它给了你很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5866.669, "timestamp": "01:37:46", "text": "更大的容错空间。我们来谈谈……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5869.27, "timestamp": "01:37:49", "text": "安全。沿原路退出。我将身处一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5870.79, "timestamp": "01:37:50", "text": "加速旋转。真的，我们该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5872.07, "timestamp": "01:37:52", "text": "想在这个画面里看到什么？我们想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5874.709, "timestamp": "01:37:54", "text": "看着我摔倒，然后我把它扔出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5877.75, "timestamp": "01:37:57", "text": "哦好的。伙计们，行动起来！他多大了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.87, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "汤姆"}]